            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Episode 3 available NOW!</h1><p>** EPISODE 3 IS AVAILABLE NOW ON THE STORE.  3 TIMES LONGER THAN EPISODE 1!! **<br><br></p><br><h1>Mini Adventure BONUS!</h1><p>The Goddess Robbery mini adventure has been added to the game as a BONUS! Now you can help Robert Robie to steal the Snake Goddess.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/536430/extras/6bd08e2127bf0c0f11dce06ae22bacbb.avif?t=1773263527\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/536430/extras/69941dab4ac1d752f0cbe8de54100f93.avif?t=1773263527\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><br><h1>Music improved!</h1><p>The latest version adds a big improvement to the game. Music has been reviewed, new music themes has been added to all scenes. Now music is really important for the game experience.</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Hilarious adventure game designed in a TV cartoonish style.<br><br>This is the story of Johnny Bonasera, a kid that was beaten and humiliated by a punk gang.<br><br>Fueled by an insatiable desire for revenge, Johnny Bonasera promises revenge against each of the punks who bullied him. One by one. Unscrupulous. Mercilessly.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li>2D HD graphics in TV cartoon style. <br> </li><li>An adventure full of hilarious dialogues and puzzles.<br> </li><li>Outlandish characters to talk, interact, beat...</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Hilarious adventure game designed in a TV cartoonish style.<br><br>This is the story of Johnny Bonasera, a kid that was beaten and humiliated by a punk gang.<br><br>Fueled by an insatiable desire for revenge, Johnny Bonasera promises revenge against each of the punks who bullied him. One by one. Unscrupulous. Mercilessly.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li>2D HD graphics in TV cartoon style. <br> </li><li>An adventure full of hilarious dialogues and puzzles.<br> </li><li>Outlandish characters to talk, interact, beat...</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Hilarious adventure game designed in a TV cartoonish style.",
